<view class="page">
  <view class="brand"><view class="brand-left"><text class="brand-mark">XM</text><text class="brand-label">希 美</text></view><text class="brand-message">日常，自有风格。</text></view>
  <view class="hero-copy"><view class="eyebrow">THE EVERYDAY EDIT / 希美衣橱</view><view class="hero-title">Quietly,<view class="line-break"></view> <text class="hero-italic">beautiful.</text></view><view class="hero-chinese">日常，自有风格。</view><view class="body-text">温柔的色彩，舒展的轮廓。<view class="line-break"></view>找到恰好适合自己的那一件。</view><button class="solid-button hero-action" bindtap="openCollection">探索服饰精选<text class="arrow">↗</text></button></view>
  <view class="hero-photo"><image src="{{hero}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="hero-photo-label">THE ART OF EVERYDAY / 店内实拍</view></view>
  <view class="section"><view class="section-head"><view><view class="eyebrow">01 / SELECTED PIECES</view><view class="section-title">衣橱精选</view></view><button class="text-button" bindtap="openCollection">查看全部 <text>↗</text></button></view><view class="product-grid"><button class="product-card" wx:for="{{featured}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openProduct"><view class="product-cover"><image src="{{item.cover}}" mode="aspectFill" lazy-load/><text class="product-category">{{item.categoryText}}</text></view><view class="product-name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="product-tags">{{item.tagsText}}</view><view class="product-meta">{{item.materialText}} · {{item.priceText}}</view></button></view></view>
  <view class="home-boutique"><image src="{{interior}}" mode="aspectFill" lazy-load/><view class="home-boutique-copy"><view class="eyebrow">02 / OUR BOUTIQUE</view><view class="section-title">在希美，慢慢找到喜欢。</view><view class="body-text">木色、暖光，与认真挑选的衣服。<view class="line-break"></view>一个能让你放慢脚步的地方。</view><button class="text-button" bindtap="openBoutique">走进希美 <text>↗</text></button></view></view>
  <view class="section share-section"><view class="section-english">Quietly, beautifully, you.</view><button class="outline-button" open-type="share">分享希美给朋友 ↗</button></view>
</view>
